    "Applies to the menu panel and widgets. Weekday and Date include the day, useful for the weekly window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gilt für das Menü-Panel und die Widgets. Wochentag und Datum zeigen den Tag – praktisch fürs Wochenfenster."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se aplica al panel del menú y a los widgets. Día y Fecha incluyen el día, útil para la ventana semanal."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’applique au panneau du menu et aux widgets. Jour et Date affichent le jour, utile pour la fenêtre hebdomadaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
